  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support personalised education for refugee youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young refugees are being denied their right to education. Data shows only 37% of refugee children globally have access to secondary education and only 6% to tertiary level. In countries like Greece, dropouts amongst older refugee children remain alarming. In response, we are launching our award-winning education programme, Gekko Kids, in Athens. Our non-traditional teaching methods and individualized approach to education will help students obtain accreditation and widen their future prospects.</narrative>
  </description>
